1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
MAN: Have you gotten used to the new software John installed on your computer yet?

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,140
It's supposed to be faster

3
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:08,140
and easier to use than the program that was originally there.

4
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:11,796
WOMAN: I don't know because I haven't had the time to use it yet.

5
00:00:11,796 --> 00:00:15,190
I've been away on a business trip and just got back this morning.

6
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:20,005
Tell you what, I will try it out this morning and let you know how it is at lunch.

7
00:00:20,005 --> 00:00:24,060
I just hope it won't take long for me to learn how to use the program.

8
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:26,020
MAN: You shouldn't have any problems with it

9
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:29,100
The command keys are exactly the same as the old program.

10
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:34,110
WOMAN: Is that right? I guess I won't have any problems using it then.
